    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/fd69c08839681fb9d2858606147045d9.poster.avif?t=1743676622\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/fd69c08839681fb9d2858606147045d9.webm?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/fd69c08839681fb9d2858606147045d9.mp4?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 2055. Corporations and syndicates rule the world undividedly. Their power is absolute. The Alliance and Syndicate wage bloody proxy wars across the planet for power and profit. The global economic crisis foreshadows a global infrastructural collapse. Lives exchange for materials and resources ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to chaos and regression, the world market is being captured by a new generation of drugs - RED. A byproduct of experiments with meta-materials. It spreads across the continents like fire. Everyone needs a small victorious War! A war for control over the markets. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/df91412d251ad33c46397a6ab6446fed.poster.avif?t=1743676622\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/df91412d251ad33c46397a6ab6446fed.webm?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/df91412d251ad33c46397a6ab6446fed.mp4?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/Weapons.gif?t=1743676622\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/f869eef90e60613dee2b46362b7485ea.poster.avif?t=1743676622\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/f869eef90e60613dee2b46362b7485ea.webm?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/f869eef90e60613dee2b46362b7485ea.mp4?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/54443fed2b700ae1d48d0b3ee84d012f.poster.avif?t=1743676622\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/54443fed2b700ae1d48d0b3ee84d012f.webm?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/54443fed2b700ae1d48d0b3ee84d012f.mp4?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Dissonators and test your skills in the world of multiplayer battles. Your strategy, tactics, and shooting skills will be put to the test! Don't miss this chance!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/fd69c08839681fb9d2858606147045d9.poster.avif?t=1743676622\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/fd69c08839681fb9d2858606147045d9.webm?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/fd69c08839681fb9d2858606147045d9.mp4?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 2055. Corporations and syndicates rule the world undividedly. Their power is absolute. The Alliance and Syndicate wage bloody proxy wars across the planet for power and profit. The global economic crisis foreshadows a global infrastructural collapse. Lives exchange for materials and resources ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to chaos and regression, the world market is being captured by a new generation of drugs - RED. A byproduct of experiments with meta-materials. It spreads across the continents like fire. Everyone needs a small victorious War! A war for control over the markets. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/df91412d251ad33c46397a6ab6446fed.poster.avif?t=1743676622\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/df91412d251ad33c46397a6ab6446fed.webm?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/df91412d251ad33c46397a6ab6446fed.mp4?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/Weapons.gif?t=1743676622\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/f869eef90e60613dee2b46362b7485ea.poster.avif?t=1743676622\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/f869eef90e60613dee2b46362b7485ea.webm?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/f869eef90e60613dee2b46362b7485ea.mp4?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/54443fed2b700ae1d48d0b3ee84d012f.poster.avif?t=1743676622\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/54443fed2b700ae1d48d0b3ee84d012f.webm?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498610/extras/54443fed2b700ae1d48d0b3ee84d012f.mp4?t=1743676622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Dissonators and test your skills in the world of multiplayer battles. Your strategy, tactics, and shooting skills will be put to the test! Don't miss this chance!</p>",
